# Engine

- Dilarang `import django`.
- Kolom: `Datetime`, `Open`, `High`, `Low`, `Close`, `Volume`.
- Entry: sinyal bar `i-1`, harga `Open[i]`.
- SL dan TP kena di bar yang sama: SL dulu.
- `MAX_POSITIONS = 1`.
- Indikator tidak menulis `signal`.

```python
# BAD
signal.iloc[i] = 1
price = Close.iloc[i]  # same-bar entry

# GOOD
if signals[i - 1] != 0:
    entry = opens[i]
```
